tle:"Replying directly in WhatsApp",whatsappHelp:"A reported manual WhatsApp reply starts a {{hours}}-hour pause, renewed by each new manual reply. The field below does not change this duration.",rulesUnavailable:"Current runtime rules could not be confirmed. Refresh the conversation list to read them again.",resumeHelp:"After expiry is processed, Sari can answer a new customer message according to reply settings, working hours and knowledge. It does not automatically send a resume message to the customer.",timeout:"Takeover duration for dashboard replies",timeoutHelp:"From 5 to 120 minutes after a staff reply from the dashboard. Choose a preset or enter a whole number.",invalidMinutes:"Enter a whole number from 5 to 120 minutes.",minutes:"{{count}} minutes",commandsHelp:"Enable #stop and #start when either is sent alone as direct text in the customer's chat. Courtesy messages and quotes do not execute commands. Disabling this does not disable manual reply detection or release an existing takeover.",pause:"Start takeover command",resume:"End takeover command",manualLimit:"A takeover without a timer may expire after {{hours}} hours. Explicit permanent silence is excluded.",commandVisibility:"The customer sees commands sent in WhatsApp. You can instead resume from the dashboard after reviewing the conversation without sending a command to the customer. Enabling the option alone sends nothing.",legacyTitle:"Legacy resume message \xB7 read only",legacyHelp:"Text retained from an older setting. The current runtime does not automatically send it. It remains visible for reference without deleting its content.",refresh:"Refresh conversations",listHelp:"This list shows conversations marked as under human control when read. An empty list does not mean auto-reply is enabled or WhatsApp is connected.",total:"Conversations under takeover: {{count}}",emptyPage:"No conversations on this page. Return to the previous page.",remaining:"{{count}} minutes until the recorded deadline",a